    \caption{Comparison between a more generic bound from Eq.~\eqref{eq:generic_entropy_bound} and the bound without gadget fusion from Eq.~\eqref{eq:entropy_bound}. Plotted is the maximum change in entanglement entropy, $\Delta S_{\rm max}$, as a function of the Pauli gadget phase $\phi$.}
